violation "audit:two-expression-languages" principle="orthogonality" found="94927dcd" note="`rock size=\"sin(30deg) * 5dmm\"` says unknown function sin and lists weightings; sin exists only in heights"
violation "audit:layer-unit-collides-kind" principle="one-job" found="94927dcd" note="`layer` is already a unit, so a param cannot be called layer, and the new layer kind collides with it"
violation "audit:three-colour-types" principle="one-way" found="94927dcd" note="Colour in dt-doc, a hand-written mirror ColourWord in dt-service, and Mode in the map format: one two-valued concept, three types and spellings"
violation "audit:element-knowledge-in-printing" principle="one-way" found="94927dcd" note="dt-print/src/plates/mod.rs matches element names to materials by hand: element knowledge outside the schema"
violation "audit:undo-after-make-hard-deletes" principle="one-job" found="94927dcd" note="the Undo after Make or Copy is a hard delete (places.js), where delete is always the Trash"
violation "audit:phone-messages-panel-overlap" principle="completeness" found="94927dcd" note="on a phone the messages panel's text overlaps its picture and the Copy button is clipped"
violation "audit:site-error-four-homes" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="an error is explained in docs/errors.html, docs/guide/errors.html, docs/standards/errors.html and docs/e/*.html; the list lives outside e/ where its pages are"
violation "audit:site-plans-on-current-state-site" principle="kernel" found="94f43e80" note="roadmap.html, design/editor.html and design/editor-mockup.html are plans on a site whose rule is current state only; index.html says 'the editor the preview is becoming'; a page kind with no reason"
violation "audit:site-preview-three-jobs" principle="one-job" found="94f43e80" note="'preview' names the editor (nav, preview.html, the dharmatiles preview command), the library's pictures (cache previews, 'preview images', --png) and the old live view"
violation "audit:site-editor-two-names" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="the nav and page title say Preview while the pages' own text says 'the editor' hundreds of times; one interface, two names"
violation "audit:site-editor-manual-twice" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="preview.html repeats the Plates (289 words), Maps (289) and Inventory (145) sections of plates.html, maps.html and inventory.html, and holds the 1,127-word build-cache explanation"
violation "audit:site-map-three-names" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="one .dmap document is 'a print list' in plates.html and 'a map' in maps.html, on two pages; 'print list' appears 49 times on the pages outside the changelog"
violation "audit:site-composing-old-words" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="composing.html defines 'solid' and 'surface' for what guide/generators.html calls a thing and a layer, in a page-local glossary that is a second place for words"
violation "audit:site-nav-flat-kinds" principle="syntax-shows-type" found="94f43e80" note="the bar is 13 flat links (xtask/src/nav.rs ENTRIES) mixing guide, program pages, standards, a plan and the changelog; a reader cannot tell a link's kind from the bar"
violation "audit:site-standards-not-in-bar" principle="completeness" found="94f43e80" note="standards/errors.html, performance.html and visual-system.html are reachable from no bar entry; only tile-system, printing and rules are listed"
violation "audit:site-nav-label-title-mismatch" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="the bar says 'Printing' for a page titled 'Printing Rules' and 'Tile system' for 'Tile System'; a label and its page's title are two spellings of one name"
violation "audit:site-two-editors" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="every live card's Open button (docs/assets/live/card.js) leads to playground.html, a second, smaller editor, while the real editor now opens on the site"
violation "audit:site-error-examples-two-ways" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="guide pages show a runnable document as a dt-example card; docs/e/*.html show their broken and fixed documents as static pre blocks (no dt-example in e/type.html)"
violation "audit:site-home-cli-table-copy" principle="one-way" found="94f43e80" note="index.html carries a hand-written table of commands with prose that the CLI's own help (clap, cli.rs) states again; two sources for one table, no generated block"
violation "hole:point:name" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a point cannot be named: `let n \"(0.3sq, 0.5sq)\"` is `can't read n: missing )`, so a point is written out wherever it is used"
violation "hole:point:import" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a point cannot be imported from a part: a part holds definitions only, and a `let` of a point cannot be read"
violation "hole:length:import" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a named length cannot be imported: `use \"./p\" n` of a part's `let n \"3dmm\"` is `./p has no definition n`"
violation "hole:angle:import" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a named angle cannot be imported: a part's `let n \"30deg\"` is not a definition `use` can bring in"
violation "hole:plain:import" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a named plain number cannot be imported: a part's `let n 3` is not a definition `use` can bring in"
violation "hole:region:import" principle="closure" found="377b25b3" note="a region cannot be imported from a part: regions belong to a tile, and a part holds definitions only"
violation "collision:bare" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`bare` is a grass control (the least share left bare) and a choice of a tree's leaves (a winter tree)"
violation "collision:blocks" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`blocks` is a weight control of a cliff's rock and the choice of its rock that is blocky granite"
violation "collision:clumps" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`clumps` is a Count on reeds and a tree's crown and a PerSquare on scatter: one name, two measures"
violation "collision:columns" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`columns` is a weight control of a cliff's rock and the choice of its rock that is basalt columns"
violation "collision:cover" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`cover` is a Share control of grass and scatter and a choice of scatter's `pattern` (a dense cover)"
violation "collision:ends" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`ends` is a control of a line (how it leaves a tile side) and a weighting function (values near the ends)"
violation "collision:flat" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`flat` is a choice (flat slabs, a flat wall top) and a weighting function (every value equally likely)"
violation "collision:height" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`height` is a length on grass, reeds, a trunk and a wall, a Share on a cliff's ledges and a plain Number on scatter's near"
violation "collision:layer" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`layer` is a unit (one printed layer), a printer setting (the layer height) and a kind word (a layer of the stack)"
violation "collision:length" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`length` is a control (how long a blade, leaf or stone is) and a kind word of a param"
violation "collision:line" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`line` is a node that draws a line through points and a printer setting (the line width)"
violation "collision:low" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`low` is a choice (half the wall top) and a weighting function (low values likelier)"
violation "collision:point" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`point` is a node, a function that makes a point in a frame and a kind word of a param"
violation "collision:region" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`region` is a node that makes an area of the tile and a kind word of a param"
violation "collision:rock" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`rock` is an element and a control of a cliff (what it is stacked from)"
violation "collision:seams" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`seams` is a top-level node (the seam words of an edge) and a control of a tile (whether lines cross an edge only at a seam)"
violation "collision:size" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`size` is squares across and up on a tile (Size) and a width on rocks and flowers (Dmm)"
violation "collision:slabs" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`slabs` is a Count (slabs across a square) on flagstones and a weight (a Number) of a cliff's rock"
violation "collision:smooth" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`smooth` is a choice (one smooth curve, planed boards) and a function (smoothstep)"
violation "collision:top" principle="one-job" found="5a7b2db9" note="`top` is a height (the band a body fills, how high a thing stands) on most elements and a Word (crenellations) on a wall"
violation "audit:word-not-a-kind" principle="completeness" found="b5dee592" note="a choice word cannot be passed: `param shape angular` (or `kind=word`) is refused since U2a, so varying one word means writing a second whole thing; the closure table cannot see it because its rows are Kind::WORDS, which has no word kind"
